flowchart TD
    WAV[Explicit mono 16 kHz WAV] --> Bounds[Validate nonempty, at most 10 seconds, repeat 1]
    Bounds --> Load[Load selected local model]
    Load --> Start[start_stream opens FIFO route]
    Start --> Feed[Feed 320-sample frames with cumulative 20 ms pacing]
    Feed --> Worker[Existing streaming worker and engine]
    Feed --> Deadline[Wait until final audio deadline]
    Deadline --> Finalize[finalize_stream: existing reply timeout and unload policy]
    Worker --> Finalize
    Finalize --> Outcome{Finalized result}
    Outcome -->|Nonempty text| Complete[complete: exit 0]
    Outcome -->|None, empty, or error| Failed[Distinct outcome: exit 1, no batch fallback]
    Complete --> JSON[JSON text and load/feed/finalize timings]
    Failed --> JSON
    Bounds -->|Invalid| Invalid[Exit 2 before model load]
    Guard[External pressure guard and whole-process deadline] -. supervises .-> Load
    Guard -. supervises .-> Finalize
    Scope[Diagnostic only: no microphone, cleanup, history, or paste]
